  "id": "procedural-learning",
  "term": "procedural learning",
  "definition": "Procedural learning is the process of acquiring skills for carrying out actions smoothly and with little effort, including everyday perceptual-motor sequences. In this source, it is described as improving with repeated practice and being influenced by sensory conditions such as regular rhythmic and matching audio-visual stimulation.",
